WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<b></b>

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.040
<b>Él es correcto</b>

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.500
<b>Now I see why you were able to
hold your own against Yoh-sama.</b>

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.670
<b>As expected of Tao Ren.</b>

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.680
<b>Hmph, Yoh-sama again?</b>

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:18.970
<b>Your boss must really be worried about him.</b>

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.560
<b>We have our reasons</b>

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.850
<b>My spirit allies, Carlos and Juan.</b>

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:32.240
<b>They're my friends.
They're mariachis, very famous in Mexico.</b>

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.990
<b>It was their combative nature, not
their music that made them famous.</b>

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.040
<b>Peyote of Team Earth!</b>

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:46.080
<b>He's using the bodies of Boz as his medium!</b>

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:52.420
<b>Their aggression is what got them killed,
riddles with lead by their own customers.</b>

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:56.970
<b>Stop belittling our manly story here, hey!</b>

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.850
<b>There's a big difference
between manliness and stupidity.</b>

