00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:39.510
<b>Ep.20</b>

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:39.510
<b>Ep.20</b>

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:39.510
<b>Chocolove's Christmas</b>

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:39.510
<b>Chocolove's Christmas</b>

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.690
<b>Why... You!</b>

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:42.700
<b>There's nothing manly about using your
own dying teammates as mediums either!</b>

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:52.510
<b>Going straight for me
instead of attacking Boz...</b>

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.880
<b>Is that the way you
show your manliness?</b>

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:57.670
<b>I was right, you're an idiot.</b>

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:02.720
<b>What are they?</b>

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:05.560
<b>Hey, there are more coming out!</b>

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.980
<b>They're Calavera dolls.</b>

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.350
<b>Calavera?</b>

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.770
<b>Skeletons of Mexico.</b>

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.230
<b>Symbols of death.</b>

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:23.180
<b>Day of the Dead</b>

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.860
<b>In Mexico they celebrate
the day of the dead.</b>

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:24.570
<b>Once a year, the dead return to this world. The
villagers celebrate by playing with the ghosts.</b>

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.450
<b>For Mexicans, the dead
are friendly and cheerful.</b>

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:33.210
<b>On that day, Calavera dolls decorate
the villages and play an important role.</b>

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.180
<b>Then these Calaveras are
symbols that link life and death.</b>

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.970
<b>In other words, he uses
bones as his medium.</b>

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.550
<b>Él es correcto!</b>

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.540
<b>I'm just a cheerful Shaman
who plays with the dead.</b>

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.270
<b>When my guitar resounds in
their souls, the ghosts dance, too.</b>

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.850
<b>They protect me.</b>

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.560
<b>And destroy my enemies.</b>

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:01.990
<b>Now you get it, don't you? I intended
to use Boz as my mediums all along.</b>

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:06.410
<b>Their flesh-covered
bones will be my weapons.</b>

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:09.040
<b>That's terrible...</b>

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:11.620
<b>I feel so bad for Boz...</b>

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.120
<b>Unforgivable.</b>

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:18.380
<b>As a bone-user myself,
I find him despicable.</b>

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.840
<b>They pursued dreams that they
were too weak to ever realize.</b>

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:28.470
<b>And they ended up dead. Some
may call that manly, but I call it stupid.</b>

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:35.900
<b>Oh well, Boz should consider it an
honor to be allowed to aid Hao-sama.</b>

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:37.940
<b>You bastard..!</b>

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:43.950
<b>Now I not only have to deal with
you, but your two teammates as well.</b>

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.820
<b>It's about time for you to retire.</b>

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:55.540
<b>My Shaft will blow you away!</b>

00:04:56.120 --> 00:05:00.380
<b>How very kind, but that's
what makes you a fool!</b>

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.050
<b>What are you doing, Chocolove!</b>

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.340
<b>Just finish Boz off first!</b>

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:08.760
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:13.470
<b>If I hit them again, they'll die!
Didn't you hear me?!</b>

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.980
<b>This is no time to worry about that!</b>

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:22.360
<b>Not again...</b>

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.450
<b>I don't want to see anybody die.</b>

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:32.790
<b>You're even stupider than I thought.</b>

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:37.920
<b>Grandpa...</b>

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:41.630
<b>If you were in my shoes, what would you do?</b>

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.830
<b>New York</b>

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.830
<b>New York</b>

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.830
<b>Year</b>

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.830
<b>Year</b>

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:51.760
<b>My kids are waiting at home for their
presents. It's Christmas, please don't do this.</b>

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:58.600
<b>You had the bad luck of crossing
paths with Shaft on the wrong day.</b>

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.610
<b>Curse your own fate.</b>

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:09.950
<b>As expected from Chocolove,
he's turning into one scary dude!</b>

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.080
<b>He'll shoot anybody!</b>

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:17.210
<b>Chocolove is the best!</b>

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.040
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.420
<b>I'm not done yet, I'm
gonna get me some more.</b>

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:24.960
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:27.220
<b>Don't be greedy!</b>

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.680
<b>It's the same every year.</b>

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:33.260
<b>He can't forget.</b>

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.470
<b>Christmas, 9 years ago.</b>

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.440
<b>That was the day he lost everything.</b>

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:49.240
<b>It wasn't Santa that showed up,
but an armed robber with a big bag.</b>

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:56.740
<b>After that, he moved from orphanage to
orphanage until he found a home with Shaft.</b>

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:06.610
<b>Chi...</b>

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:07.710
<b>Blood!</b>

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:13.140
<b>The cold of New York is
hard on the body indeed.</b>

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:16.430
<b>Huh?! Hey, this ain't
the time to be carefree.</b>

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:18.140
<b>Just kidding!</b>

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.980
<b>It's a blood bag that I use in my show.</b>

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.230
<b>It's just a gag.</b>

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:25.570
<b>You said Chi and I was bleeding.</b>

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:25.570
 Tl note: Chi means blood

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:31.110
<b>I guess my humor's too highbrow for you.</b>

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.990
<b>Well, there is no way to do that</b>

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.910
<b>Anyways, I'm a traveling comedian.</b>

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.870
<b>I hope I was of some help to you.</b>

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.040
<b>Laughter is a wind</b>

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:47.630
<b>When I saw your sour
face, I had to do something.</b>

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:48.920
<b>Get lost.</b>

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:52.720
<b>I don't care who you
are, don't mess with me.</b>

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:56.470
<b>I'm kinda cranky today,
so you're going to die.</b>

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.350
<b>I'm kinda hungry today!</b>

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.650
<b>This gun ain't a joke.</b>

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.580
<b>I've got enough of this guy.</b>

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.200
<b>All the worst scum
comes out on Christmas.</b>

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:14.910
<b>You're dead meat now.</b>

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.540
<b>What good does killing do?</b>

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:26.040
<b>Has killing ever made
you feel better, even once?</b>

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.420
<b>You're a sad child who's
forgotten how to laugh.</b>

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.130
<b>Try laughing</b>

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:36.140
<b>Laughter is a wind.</b>

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:41.890
<b>The only way to blow the darkness out
of your heart is to laugh and forget it.</b>

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.730
<b>You have very sad eyes.</b>

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.650
<b>This guy…</b>

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.690
<b>You're the one who won't be laughing!</b>

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.190
<b>Ah well.</b>

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:56.360
<b>I see I'll have to resort to violence.</b>

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:00.080
<b>I still have a lot to learn.</b>

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:05.410
<b>It'll be a long time before I
can save the world with laughter.</b>

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:17.220
<b>Did you say: "Save the world with laughter"?</b>

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:18.760
<b>Huh?</b>

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:20.860
<b>That's crazy!</b>

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:23.950
<b>That's the funniest
thing I've heard in a while!</b>

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.400
<b>Really?!</b>

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.860
<b>You can't do that.</b>

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:32.320
<b>This world is full of enemies.</b>

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:35.530
<b>But I'll let you off the hook this time.</b>

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:36.860
<b>Just hurry.</b>

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:42.200
<b>Your stupid gag has
put me in a bad mood.</b>

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.790
<b>Is that so?</b>

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.210
<b>Sheesh</b>

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.500
<b>All the worst scum comes out on Christmas.</b>

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.090
<b>Get lost, like I said!</b>

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:56.300
<b>I don't care for sad goodbyes.</b>

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:01.140
<b>By the way, how'd you do that?</b>

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:04.770
<b>And what's that thing that hit me?</b>

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:09.190
<b>What, you can see Mic?</b>

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.520
<b>Oh, I've find him at last!</b>

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:16.990
<b>The one who will be my successor!</b>

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.210
<b>Ah, that's much better.</b>

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:38.840
<b>It's a lot easier to get outta bed now those
cold spring mornings are behind us, huh, Mic?</b>

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.620
<b>It's not as cold as it was in the spring...</b>

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.640
<b>But it's just right for
wearing a pharaoh mask!</b>

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.310
<b>Can't you wait until after breakfast?</b>

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:53.900
<b>Now then, shall we begin
our Shaman training?</b>

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:55.400
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:10:57.740 --> 00:11:00.530
<b>Nothing beats an
ice-cold cola after training!</b>

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.740
<b>Oh, that's right!</b>

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:08.410
<b>We'd better get the groceries before
the old man starts with his punishing puns.</b>

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:14.880
<b>Things sure turn out in
unexpected ways sometimes.</b>

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.670
<b>I was living with the old man and Mic.</b>

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.470
<b>It's not like I asked to stay.</b>

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:26.140
<b>But he said he'd teach me
his tricks, and I was curious.</b>

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:31.030
<b>The old man's name was
Olona, a Native American Shaman.</b>

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:35.260
<b>He said he was a traveling comedian,
but there was something mysterious...</b>

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:41.530
<b>You know, his puns aren't very funny...</b>

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:45.950
<b>Hey, been a while, Chocolove.</b>

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.330
<b>Y-you guys!</b>

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:53.790
<b>Hey hey, you sure have mellowed out.</b>

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:55.840
<b>We've been looking for you.</b>

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:59.590
<b>Huh? I told you I quit Shaft.</b>

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.090
<b>Did you really think you could quit?</b>

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:06.300
<b>It's hard getting money without you.</b>

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:11.520
<b>You're Shaft's number one killer.</b>

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:14.230
<b>Just chill.</b>

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.940
<b>We came to take you back.</b>

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:21.440
<b>I beat up that old man
who took you away from us.</b>

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.200
<b>Old man, are you alright?!</b>

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.240
<b>Chocolove...</b>

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:32.410
<b>Why didn't you beat
them up with that move?!</b>

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:37.000
<b>I can't fight without Mic.</b>

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:38.460
<b>H-huh?</b>

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:42.920
<b>Hey hey, aren't we good enough for you?</b>

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:48.300
<b>You bastards, how dare
you hurt the old man..!</b>

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:51.520
<b>Whoa! That's the crazy face I remember</b>

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.680
<b>Don't do it, Chocolove.</b>

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.150
<b>Don't give in to anger.</b>

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:00.480
<b>Don't worry about me</b>

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.240
<b>Huh? That's not what this is about.</b>

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:08.950
<b>You've been brainwashed.</b>

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:11.160
<b>But I'll open your eyes.</b>

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:14.250
<b>Cut it out right now!
Put down your gun!</b>

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:19.080
<b>You sound like one
of the dudes you killed.</b>

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.250
<b>Shit...</b>

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:23.090
<b>Didn't you hear me?
I told you not to get angry.</b>

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.970
<b>Rage redeems no one.</b>

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:31.680
<b>You should know that better than anyone.</b>

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.140
<b>Chocolove</b>

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.730
<b>Are you blind? You have to do something!</b>

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.520
<b>I don't care if I die.</b>

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:42.570
<b>I'm an old man with an incurable disease.</b>

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:46.780
<b>No way, so the blood..?</b>

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:50.240
<b>But if you bare your fangs...</b>

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:56.580
<b>And turn to violence again,
I can never rest in peace.</b>

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:57.790
<b>You..!</b>

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:03.170
<b>My home was in the heart of the Amazon.</b>

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:06.130
<b>Our young people were
seduced by the modern world...</b>

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:10.830
<b>They flocked to the cities, now
many tribes have disappeared.</b>

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.430
<b>And look at this city.</b>

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:22.190
<b>People strive against each other, wearing
out their bodies and souls, and for what?</b>

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:26.940
<b>True happiness was
never won through conflict.</b>

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:31.490
<b>True happiness is born
of laughter and harmony.</b>

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:32.620
<b>Hey!</b>

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.240
<b>Chocolove</b>

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:38.710
<b>The Jaguar is the most
powerful and noble beast.</b>

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:46.050
<b>Like the Shaman, it sees
all and knows the truth.</b>

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.930
<b>At that time your soul was full of rage...</b>

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.600
<b>The winds of laughter blew that away...</b>

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.220
<b>You can do it.</b>

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:03.230
<b>Be one with Mic's spirit.
Become the noble jaguar.</b>

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:06.360
<b>You are the black jaguar!</b>

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:11.240
<b>Save the world with the winds of laughter.</b>

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:15.910
<b>What a fool.</b>

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:22.080
<b>Save the world with laughter?</b>

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:26.710
<b>But his jokes were never any good.</b>

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.130
<b>I'll do it.</b>

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:37.560
<b>I'll make folks laugh so
hard, they'll be blown away!</b>

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.310
<b>Here I go!</b>

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.480
<b>Over Soul...</b>

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.570
<b>Gag Wind!</b>

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:54.490
<b>What is this?</b>

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:58.410
<b>There's something I have to do.</b>

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:02.040
<b>Bury them with laughter!</b>

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:03.750
<b>Laughter?</b>

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:07.090
<b>That was unexpected.</b>

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:11.550
<b>There's nothing less funny
than a joke with too much buildup.</b>

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.590
<b>We'll see about that!</b>

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:17.890
<b>Here's my ultimate move,
with all my Furyoku in it!</b>

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:20.850
<b>Let's go, Mic!</b>

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:25.060
<b>Over Soul
Ayers Rock!</b>

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:38.620
<b>Th-This is…</b>

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:41.330
<b>Also called "The Navel of the World"</b>

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:46.080
<b>That thing is supposed to look like Ayers Rock?</b>

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.040
<b>That guy...</b>

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.210
<b>He totally bombed.</b>

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.470
<b>I told you so.</b>

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:57.090
<b>You're too boring.</b>

00:16:57.890 --> 00:16:59.350
<b>Get him, Boz!</b>

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:03.850
<b>A clown should be dealt with by clowns!</b>

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:05.100
<b>Jerk!</b>

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.190
<b>Don't try it, Horohoro</b>

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.610
<b>The joke's not over yet.</b>

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:14.400
<b>Peyote, come over here or are you scared?</b>

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:20.080
<b>Because you just laughed
your ass off just now.</b>

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:23.330
<b>I didn't, I was just mocking you.</b>

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.540
<b>Huh, what the..?</b>

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:32.090
<b>His outie resembles a tiny
version of the Earth's belly button!</b>

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:34.420
<b>That kangaroo figure is handmade.</b>

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:38.760
<b>It's a complicated joke with two steps.</b>

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:43.020
<b>But did you actually think
this would make me laugh?</b>

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.480
<b>What are you guys doing!</b>

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:58.570
<b>But how can they be laughing?
My Furyoku is controlling them.</b>

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:00.620
<b>I blew 'em away.</b>

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:06.080
<b>The wind of laughter can free
souls that are possessed by evil.</b>

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:10.210
<b>I learned that from the old man.</b>

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:12.960
<b>Nice one, Chocolove!</b>

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:17.090
<b>You don't even treat your
minions like humans beings!</b>

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:20.050
<b>That's no way to motivate anyone.</b>

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:28.730
<b>I got excited and used up all my Furyoku...</b>

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:31.190
<b>I'm still not good enough...</b>

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:34.690
<b>The rest is up to you, Ren...</b>

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.320
<b>Well done, Chocolove.</b>

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:42.280
<b>You fools, stop laughing!</b>

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.660
<b>Even if your dolls were here...</b>

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:49.210
<b>I would blow them away without a problem.</b>

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:55.250
<b>He isn't bluffing.</b>

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:58.920
<b>This man's Furyoku is awesome...</b>

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:06.010
<b>You've underestimated Chocolove.</b>

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.810
<b>That's Ren's power...</b>

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.020
<b>Impossible, right now his Furyoku is..</b>

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.650
<b>5721</b>

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:19.320
<b>I see, Peyote never stood a chance.</b>

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:23.700
<b>But I was sure that Tao Ren's
Furyoku was less than 1000 before!</b>

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:25.120
<b>So it increased.</b>

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:30.500
<b>He looked into the
heart of the Great Spirit.</b>

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:36.000
<b>When one's worldview is
shattered by such a powerful vision...</b>

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.460
<b>There's an opportunity for growth</b>

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:43.970
<b>And he took that opportunity
from the Great Spirit.</b>

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:48.140
<b>Victory for Team The Ren!</b>

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:51.690
<b>We did it, Ren!
We won the match!</b>

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.560
<b>You didn't do anything.</b>

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:58.690
<b>Just thank him.</b>

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:03.860
<b>His jokes aren't funny, but
his spirit deserves respect.</b>

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:06.280
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.330
<b>Did you see me?</b>

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:14.330
<b>I won without killing anybody.</b>

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:19.550
<b>My old friends from Shaft are
here, too. You helped them all.</b>

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:23.430
<b>Even though none of them can see spirits.</b>

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.640
<b>We're your tribe now.</b>

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:32.770
<b>Mic's passing on all your teachings.</b>

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:35.560
<b>So don't worry about me.</b>

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:40.440
<b>Heh, it was touch and go there for a while.</b>

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:43.030
<b>You still have a lot to learn.</b>

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:47.780
<b>You have a great responsibility, Chocolove.</b>

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.330
<b>Hey, Hey, Hey!</b>

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:56.710
<b>How does it feel to have won, captain?</b>

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:01.920
<b>Yoh, I shall defeat you.</b>

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:07.370
<b>Only one team can win in this
block, and that will be Team The Ren.</b>

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:09.390
<b>Hey</b>

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.730
<b>That's my boy.</b>

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:15.770
<b>Ren's the best!</b>

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:19.480
<b>Father!</b>

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.360
<b>Ren, Good luck!</b>

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:23.440
<b>Your sister's here for you!</b>

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:26.910
<b>Your family's pepped up some!</b>

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:29.450
<b>I will kill my father.</b>

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.580
<b>I'm really happy for Ren.</b>

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:37.120
<b>Are you out of your mind?</b>

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:40.590
<b>He declared war on you.</b>

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.090
<b>Can't you at least taunt him?</b>

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.050
<b>It's all right, Anna.</b>

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:50.550
<b>I'll deal with it when the time comes.</b>

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:56.850
<b>We're a bit late, but..</b>

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:03.900
<b>It looks good on you.</b>

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:07.900
<b>X-Laws, Lyserg Diethel</b>

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:11.910
<b>The next match is starting.</b>

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.410
<b>Let's hurry, Marco.</b>

